            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Arai kikamun etuŋanan ekokoi idiokoinacanake luka idwe luka Isirael, kikonak ŋes bala ebulesit, arai agwelar ŋes; eario do ekokolan ŋol: ilemari kwaŋin aronis kamakon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.7"
            ]
