            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kocoito adeka naka atapon, koric kojokan aswam kere nukisisianakinete yes isasedotin Ilebin: kwape ecorakinia eoŋ kes, iricete yesi aswam kwaŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
