              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Naisakia emanikorikon, kimurwok eisuta komanikor, sirikiboŋo aomare: eraun loka imoit, ka ikoki, ka apuserut: tetere kisirereŋi jo EJAKAIT Ekonideke kaswamisio kere nuka akaninikon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naideŋio araito nuka ekitoikon loka eseitun, sirikinyogok bobo aide atenunake: eraunos ŋun nuka imoit, ka ikoki, ka apuserut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitukonokinia imusabibun luka emanikorikon loka emusabibu, sirikinyogok bobo: eraunos ŋul luka imoit, ka ikoki, ka apuserut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iituni ebe irai kolo ebulesit kakwap nako Misiri: kanuka ŋun ŋes kecorakinia jo aiswamaenen ŋun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.22"
            ]
